WEBVTT

01:30.320 --> 01:33.800
ADAPTED FROM THE BLOSSOMING LOVE
BY SUI YU ER AN ON ICEREAD.COM

01:43.320 --> 01:45.120
How long do you want to play?

01:54.920 --> 01:57.480
The fog was too thick,
so I just had a momentary lapse.

01:59.440 --> 02:00.280
Where's my bracelet?

02:01.160 --> 02:02.760
I dropped my bracelet in.

02:02.840 --> 02:04.960
It's in Everlife Pond. Take it out…

02:12.160 --> 02:14.040
Thanks, Your Grace.

02:15.440 --> 02:16.320
Can we go now?

02:22.560 --> 02:24.400
In that case,
I'll have to do it the hard way.

02:25.080 --> 02:26.080
The chances are slim,

02:26.680 --> 02:28.040
but I can only rely on force.

02:30.280 --> 02:31.720
This is Saint Feng Xiang.

02:32.400 --> 02:33.640
God favors me.

02:43.560 --> 02:45.240
How dare you pick Lotus of Life?

02:49.520 --> 02:51.960
Here's my chance.
I don't mind getting hurt.

03:10.760 --> 03:12.440
Now that we have
the Lotus of Life, let's go.

03:12.520 --> 03:14.240
You don't have to fight her here.

03:14.320 --> 03:15.720
Want to leave?

03:15.800 --> 03:17.160
Not that easy.

03:28.560 --> 03:29.800
Want to leave?

03:29.880 --> 03:32.520
Why is a Dark Abyss
demonic cultivator in the human realm?

03:33.160 --> 03:36.560
So, the Immortals Array
has been compromised?

03:37.520 --> 03:38.920
Saint.

03:39.000 --> 03:39.920
We meant no harm.

03:40.640 --> 03:42.480
Look. The Lotus of Life
doesn't grow to maturity,

03:42.560 --> 03:44.400
so even if we eat it,
we won't get longevity.

03:44.480 --> 03:45.640
However,

03:45.720 --> 03:48.320
an old friend of mine once saved me
with the seed of this lotus,

03:48.920 --> 03:52.160
so I would like to keep this
to build a burial mound for him.

03:52.240 --> 03:55.160
Picking Lotus of Life
to build a burial mound?

03:55.240 --> 03:56.640
Such arrogance.

04:38.200 --> 04:39.040
Don't kill her.

05:08.760 --> 05:09.600
Qian Guang.

05:20.600 --> 05:21.680
Why are you here?

05:23.640 --> 05:25.840
Feng Xiang. I've always been here.

05:46.920 --> 05:50.280
Qian Guang and Feng Xiang's predicament
was created by cyclic power,

05:50.360 --> 05:52.280
so how did you make them meet?

05:52.800 --> 05:54.720
I can even kill the immortal,

05:55.240 --> 05:58.040
so how could I have been
suppressed by a mere cyclic power?

05:58.760 --> 06:00.360
But Cycles of Rebirth said

06:00.440 --> 06:04.200
the price was demanded by Fate
and irrevocable.

06:04.720 --> 06:06.120
Irrevocable?

06:07.160 --> 06:09.480
I'm the one who broke Fate,

06:09.560 --> 06:12.560
so what can Fate's rules do to me?

06:14.560 --> 06:16.880
Even if you could break
Cycles of Rebirth's curse,

06:17.600 --> 06:19.040
why would you do it?

06:20.920 --> 06:22.400
Are you doing it

06:22.480 --> 06:25.520
to help Qian Guang and Feng Xiang
make up for their regrets?

06:30.040 --> 06:31.760
Your Grace,

06:31.840 --> 06:36.120
you've been so kind
and serious about helping others.

06:39.840 --> 06:41.800
Kind and serious?

07:15.360 --> 07:16.200
Long time no see.

07:19.040 --> 07:20.560
It's been a long time, Qian Guang,

07:21.360 --> 07:22.800
but it seems you've mistaken me

07:23.800 --> 07:24.960
for someone else this time.

07:25.600 --> 07:26.720
You look like someone from the past,

07:27.640 --> 07:28.480
but you're not.

07:28.560 --> 07:31.480
I bear no resemblance to him.

07:32.040 --> 07:34.320
Did you come here with the other one?

07:35.720 --> 07:37.480
If you are still in the same predicament,

07:37.560 --> 07:38.400
are you still willing
to fight to the death

07:39.080 --> 07:40.200
to save her?

07:42.760 --> 07:45.200
Your so-called love is ridiculous.

07:46.120 --> 07:48.520
Qian Guang, you don't have to be so eager

07:48.600 --> 07:50.160
to argue my relationship with him.

07:52.080 --> 07:54.040
You have been ridding
the world of demons for so many years,

07:54.920 --> 07:56.240
so you should be well aware
of the vast differences

07:57.000 --> 07:58.880
between demons and righteous people.

07:59.400 --> 08:00.400
There is a difference in what you want

08:01.280 --> 08:02.160
but not in your original intentions.

08:02.840 --> 08:04.960
Why did you come here?

08:08.960 --> 08:12.560
Feng Xiang has been trapped
by the One-day Samsara for 6,000 years.

08:12.640 --> 08:16.320
This false and ridiculous longevity
has tortured her endlessly.

08:17.120 --> 08:19.520
You want to help her but you can't,

08:19.600 --> 08:22.200
but what if I could help you?

08:24.040 --> 08:24.880
Do you know how?

08:24.960 --> 08:26.960
In ancient times, there were ten suns,

08:27.040 --> 08:28.520
nine of which were struck down.

08:30.400 --> 08:33.840
Dark Cloud Mountain
is where those nine suns are buried.

08:34.440 --> 08:37.240
The power of the heavens and the earth
does not come out of nowhere.

08:38.559 --> 08:40.280
The One-day Samsara from Cycles of Rebirth

08:40.360 --> 08:43.240
was created
by the cyclical power of the nine suns.

08:44.200 --> 08:46.800
I can remove the power of the nine suns
with a blood moon

08:46.880 --> 08:49.120
and make the One-day Samsara
dissipate instantly,

08:49.960 --> 08:51.040
but…

08:51.800 --> 08:53.960
I've been here with Feng Xiang
for 6,000 years,

08:54.040 --> 08:56.200
and I know the cost
and what we want are always equal,

08:57.840 --> 08:58.840
so, let's get right to it.

09:00.160 --> 09:01.720
Based on Feng Xiang's injuries back then,

09:01.800 --> 09:03.880
without One-day Samsara,

09:04.400 --> 09:05.800
she wouldn't have survived
more than a few years.

09:06.320 --> 09:09.680
She stole 6,000 years of her life
with One-day Samsara.

09:10.200 --> 09:12.160
If One-day Samsara dissolves,

09:12.240 --> 09:13.800
she will also die

09:14.640 --> 09:16.840
to repay the loss of the rules.

09:18.960 --> 09:22.080
Since you have come to me,
you must have a solution.

09:22.600 --> 09:23.800
Tell me

09:24.600 --> 09:25.480
how to solve it.

09:27.200 --> 09:28.320
It's not hard to solve it.

09:30.520 --> 09:32.360
It only requires the exchange of lives.

09:38.280 --> 09:39.800
If I trade my life for hers,

09:41.000 --> 09:41.840
will she live?

09:43.280 --> 09:44.320
Qian Guang.

09:46.760 --> 09:48.320
You have to think clearly.

10:07.360 --> 10:08.720
Don't think too well of me.

10:09.480 --> 10:12.200
My intentions have always been unjust.

10:13.040 --> 10:17.480
Is there no compassion in that injustice?

10:18.440 --> 10:19.280
Of course not.

10:22.520 --> 10:24.240
Well, I wouldn't doubt it.

10:25.560 --> 10:26.400
Wait.

10:27.440 --> 10:28.280
So,

10:29.480 --> 10:32.960
the long life I crave is only for one day.

10:36.040 --> 10:37.000
It was my fault.

10:37.760 --> 10:39.560
My hesitation and cowardice

10:40.800 --> 10:42.880
have resulted in irreparable regret.

10:45.280 --> 10:46.880
You're not the only one

10:49.680 --> 10:51.440
who didn't say what you should have said.

10:53.640 --> 10:56.320
Since we weren't meant to be,
we could have just missed it,

10:57.120 --> 10:59.240
but why did you get involved
in this curse?

11:00.640 --> 11:02.120
Because I don't accept it.

11:02.760 --> 11:04.120
I wanted to force it

11:04.960 --> 11:08.240
and see if the outcome would be different.

11:10.400 --> 11:12.600
Is that what you want to see?

11:14.200 --> 11:15.920
I'm trapped in One-day Samsara,

11:16.000 --> 11:19.600
and you have been spending 6,000 years
just by breaking free

11:20.880 --> 11:23.920
for a moment while I sleep.

11:30.840 --> 11:31.680
Feng Xiang.

11:33.600 --> 11:34.800
You may not remember

11:36.000 --> 11:38.560
that we also had over 30,000 days

11:38.640 --> 11:40.520
of loving each other.

11:41.480 --> 11:43.760
In the first hundred years
after I found you,

11:44.360 --> 11:46.200
we actually saw each other day after day.

12:03.520 --> 12:05.200
Why…

12:05.280 --> 12:07.720
-Why are you here?
-Feng Xiang.

12:11.360 --> 12:12.920
I came just to see you.

12:14.040 --> 12:15.240
How are you hurt?

12:19.800 --> 12:21.840
You don't need to worry about me.

12:26.520 --> 12:29.840
Lotus of Life will take time to mature,
but I will wait with you.

12:33.720 --> 12:35.200
How do you know
I'm waiting for Lotus of Life?

12:38.960 --> 12:41.920
I've been following you since you left,

12:42.600 --> 12:44.520
so I naturally know what you seek.

12:45.040 --> 12:46.680
What you seek

12:46.760 --> 12:49.800
is the cultivation and me, right?

12:54.800 --> 12:57.320
If you don't want to answer, I'll do it.

12:57.400 --> 12:59.280
In my life,

12:59.800 --> 13:03.720
I care about the world and you.

13:05.040 --> 13:06.600
This love will not die.

13:12.720 --> 13:14.600
But you said before

13:15.520 --> 13:16.880
that you already have someone you love.

13:21.560 --> 13:24.480
But why can't it be you?

13:26.080 --> 13:27.320
That person

13:28.640 --> 13:29.520
was always you.

13:31.160 --> 13:32.160
Feng Xiang.

13:33.560 --> 13:36.400
Will you forgive me for my cowardice
and stupidity

13:37.920 --> 13:39.640
and be willing to start over with me?

13:44.920 --> 13:45.800
Why didn't you

13:48.400 --> 13:49.720
say this earlier?

13:57.920 --> 13:58.880
Between the eternal life and you,

14:01.800 --> 14:02.800
I choose you.

14:40.400 --> 14:41.560
Feng Xiang.

14:41.640 --> 14:44.000
I've come just to see you.
How is your wound?

14:49.640 --> 14:50.640
You don't need to worry about me.

14:51.280 --> 14:52.560
I have things to do.

14:56.000 --> 14:57.080
Qian Guang, go back
to the Immortal Alliance.

14:58.680 --> 14:59.840
Thanks to you,

14:59.920 --> 15:02.840
the Dark Clan has been sealed
and the human realm is safe now.

15:08.280 --> 15:10.800
Aren't you bored here alone?

15:12.240 --> 15:14.240
-Of course not.
-But I am bored

15:14.320 --> 15:15.680
and need your company.

15:16.600 --> 15:18.000
I don't have time for that.

15:22.440 --> 15:24.960
Don't worry. I do.

15:27.280 --> 15:30.520
Every day you wake up, you don't remember.

15:31.640 --> 15:35.400
Every day you wake up,
we're in love again.

15:40.480 --> 15:41.360
Feng Xiang.

15:42.680 --> 15:44.000
Will you forgive me

15:45.000 --> 15:47.560
and give me a chance to start over?

15:48.880 --> 15:51.240
Why are you so skillful?

15:54.680 --> 15:56.920
Do you have another favorite?

15:58.960 --> 16:00.600
Of course not.

16:04.800 --> 16:07.720
My heart is only for you.

16:16.760 --> 16:18.120
How could I have another favorite?

16:18.800 --> 16:20.760
I've been repeating the same confessions

16:20.840 --> 16:23.520
and entanglements for over 30,000 days,

16:24.480 --> 16:25.760
so I'm just skillful.

16:27.160 --> 16:28.360
Six thousand years.

16:30.040 --> 16:32.160
Over two million days and nights.

16:33.880 --> 16:35.600
You're the only one

16:37.160 --> 16:38.800
who knows and remembers it.

16:40.200 --> 16:42.120
In fact, it's not me who suffers

16:44.000 --> 16:44.960
but you.

16:54.560 --> 16:55.880
There's something I want to tell you.

16:58.160 --> 16:59.280
Actually,

17:00.280 --> 17:03.280
I fell in love with you a long time ago.

17:05.160 --> 17:08.760
I want to confess my feelings to you
while I still remember.

17:10.680 --> 17:14.760
Did I say that in those 30,000 days?

17:18.200 --> 17:19.240
That's good.

17:22.200 --> 17:24.040
Actually, it's my fault
that we missed each other

17:25.079 --> 17:26.440
for 6,000 years.

17:30.040 --> 17:31.480
My pride wouldn't allow me

17:33.240 --> 17:35.680
to show that in the slightest
in front of you.

17:39.240 --> 17:41.640
Your pride is not at fault.

17:43.120 --> 17:45.720
Saint Feng Xiang,
you are talented, beautiful,

17:46.440 --> 17:47.760
and honorable.

17:48.280 --> 17:50.920
You should be proud in your lifetime.

17:56.120 --> 17:59.760
So, what about the blood moon tonight

18:01.040 --> 18:03.160
and our meeting?

18:08.600 --> 18:10.160
For breaking your One-day Samsara.

18:10.240 --> 18:11.680
At what cost?

18:15.320 --> 18:17.160
My soul will vanish,

18:17.960 --> 18:22.280
so, tonight
will be my last night in this world.

18:22.960 --> 18:24.960
If it's in exchange for your life,
I won't allow it.

18:25.040 --> 18:27.040
From the moment we met,

18:28.640 --> 18:30.200
it was a foregone conclusion.

18:33.240 --> 18:35.440
It's that man from earlier. I'll beg him.

18:36.560 --> 18:38.200
That's what I begged.

18:39.040 --> 18:42.360
At first, I made a wish
to Cycles of Rebirth because I was afraid

18:43.280 --> 18:45.000
I wouldn't be able to be with you forever,

18:45.840 --> 18:47.880
but after 6,000 years, I finally realized

18:49.360 --> 18:50.800
that immortality

18:52.240 --> 18:53.920
isn't the true meaning of life

18:55.000 --> 18:59.000
and that being together forever
isn't the only proof of love.

19:00.960 --> 19:04.120
Do you remember what I told you

19:05.560 --> 19:06.840
when I first met you?

19:10.680 --> 19:12.560
How can we break the spiritual form

19:14.840 --> 19:16.920
without seeing all beings?

19:19.160 --> 19:21.040
How can we attain immortality

19:22.720 --> 19:24.560
without doing what
is right in front of us?

19:26.800 --> 19:27.880
Feng Xiang.

19:28.560 --> 19:29.880
You shouldn't be stuck here

19:30.480 --> 19:34.320
but go out into the world
and see how people live.

19:37.560 --> 19:39.320
But you will die.

19:39.400 --> 19:43.560
You and I are allies, comrades,
and companions.

19:44.080 --> 19:45.240
No matter what we are,

19:48.760 --> 19:50.200
apart from the bond,

19:51.160 --> 19:52.480
there is another word between us,

19:53.560 --> 19:54.840
fulfillment.

19:56.440 --> 19:57.480
Feng Xiang.

19:58.640 --> 19:59.720
Forgive me.

20:00.440 --> 20:01.560
This time, I will go first,

20:04.920 --> 20:08.640
but I don't want you
to feel the pain of loss,

20:13.320 --> 20:15.280
so I will erase your memory.

20:16.360 --> 20:17.680
When you wake up,

20:18.200 --> 20:21.440
you will forget me
and this 6,000-year-old obsession.

20:24.120 --> 20:25.240
Promise me

20:26.360 --> 20:27.800
to be a happy

20:29.160 --> 20:32.680
and carefree Feng Xiang
after you forget me,

20:33.720 --> 20:34.560
okay?

20:35.880 --> 20:37.400
What if I don't?

20:37.480 --> 20:39.280
Then I will force you once more.

20:41.560 --> 20:42.440
Feng Xiang.

20:44.160 --> 20:45.200
You know it.

20:47.080 --> 20:48.520
I have a way.

20:55.720 --> 20:59.920
Every time I fight you, I always lose.

21:03.160 --> 21:04.040
Feng Xiang.

21:05.320 --> 21:06.600
You just need to sleep

21:08.160 --> 21:09.200
a little more.

21:16.920 --> 21:18.320
When I wake up from my sleep,

21:18.840 --> 21:21.120
I will forget you completely and utterly.

21:23.760 --> 21:24.720
At that time,

21:25.600 --> 21:27.400
I'll see the world

21:28.600 --> 21:30.000
and their lives.

21:32.360 --> 21:33.680
Don't regret it.

21:36.520 --> 21:37.360
OK.

21:38.800 --> 21:39.640
OK.

22:14.640 --> 22:17.400
You're quite interesting.

22:18.840 --> 22:20.360
Feng Xiang.

22:20.440 --> 22:23.880
I've had a favorite for a long time.

23:09.120 --> 23:11.360
Thank you for helping me fulfill my dream.

23:12.680 --> 23:13.680
Thank us?

23:14.400 --> 23:15.320
For what?

23:15.400 --> 23:19.680
My death gives Feng Xiang a new life,
so I must thank you.

23:19.760 --> 23:21.160
We're just getting what we want.

23:22.680 --> 23:24.560
I have erased Feng Xiang's memory.

23:24.640 --> 23:26.960
She won't remember me when she wakes up.

23:27.840 --> 23:30.840
Phoenix Perch Forest is dangerous,
and Feng Xiang is weak tonight,

23:31.840 --> 23:34.520
so I'd like to ask you for one more favor.

23:34.600 --> 23:36.920
Please take care of her. Thank you.

23:37.920 --> 23:41.200
You and your love
won't be remembered by her,

23:41.280 --> 23:42.360
which means it's all gone.

23:42.440 --> 23:44.080
Are you really willing to do that?

23:44.600 --> 23:45.800
Love doesn't be gone.

23:46.320 --> 23:49.760
Her everyday happiness and carefreeness
are where my love belongs.

24:16.280 --> 24:17.440
Let's go.

24:17.520 --> 24:20.280
Then I'll follow you to meet the living

24:20.360 --> 24:21.640
and finish what is in front of us.

24:22.160 --> 24:23.920
How are you doing on Osprey Island?

24:24.000 --> 24:25.720
I appreciate your concern.

24:26.320 --> 24:27.280
All is well.

24:30.880 --> 24:33.120
Saint Feng Xiang stole the array's diagram

24:33.200 --> 24:34.640
and was taken into the Death Door.

24:40.760 --> 24:42.120
Time flies.

24:43.400 --> 24:46.440
A thousand years is just a moment.

25:12.480 --> 25:13.440
Cherish what you deserve.

25:14.720 --> 25:15.920
Don't wait.

26:30.080 --> 26:31.520
Why are you still here?

26:32.040 --> 26:34.040
Do you know us?

26:35.880 --> 26:38.080
I'm not old enough to be forgetful.

26:38.680 --> 26:41.360
Yesterday, you came to Waterless Land
for the Lotus of Life

26:41.440 --> 26:43.280
and fought me.

26:43.360 --> 26:44.200
Have you forgotten?

26:44.280 --> 26:46.320
She knows what happened yesterday,

26:46.400 --> 26:48.160
so the curse of One-day Samsara
has been broken.

26:52.080 --> 26:53.160
So, did you lose or win?

26:54.680 --> 26:56.160
You're so narrow-minded,

26:56.760 --> 27:00.200
but I won't deny that you're above me.

27:00.720 --> 27:01.560
I lost.

27:01.640 --> 27:05.680
If you want Lotus of Life, take it.

27:05.760 --> 27:08.560
The Lotus of Life takes
a hundred years to bloom.

27:08.640 --> 27:11.320
If you want it, you'll have to wait
another hundred years here.

27:13.280 --> 27:17.000
Waiting here for 100 years
just for a Lotus of Life?

27:17.880 --> 27:18.920
Boring.

27:19.560 --> 27:20.960
So boring.

27:21.480 --> 27:23.160
Didn't you come to Waterless Land

27:23.680 --> 27:25.720
to find the Lotus of Life
and achieve immortality?

27:26.440 --> 27:27.600
Immortality?

27:28.120 --> 27:31.240
I'm just curious
if there's a Lotus of Life in this place

27:31.760 --> 27:33.000
not to achieve immortality.

27:34.000 --> 27:35.360
Besides, girl,

27:35.880 --> 27:39.800
do you really think
immortality is a blessing?

27:47.160 --> 27:48.960
You're going to look for Qian Guang?

27:50.960 --> 27:52.480
Who is Qian Guang?

27:54.080 --> 27:55.440
Why should I look for him?

27:56.600 --> 27:57.800
Everyone knows

27:57.880 --> 28:01.000
that Qian Guang was the first Lord
of the Immortal Alliance.

28:02.960 --> 28:04.000
The Immortal Alliance is a bunch

28:04.080 --> 28:05.920
of stereotypical guys who only
fight demons and protect the world.

28:06.600 --> 28:08.400
I don't want to be associated with them.

28:09.360 --> 28:10.360
I couldn't agree more.

28:12.480 --> 28:15.000
So, where are you going now?

28:15.080 --> 28:16.240
I haven't decided yet,

28:17.440 --> 28:19.200
but since the world is so big,

28:20.640 --> 28:22.600
there must be some
lively and interesting places.

28:24.920 --> 28:27.080
I advise you not to stay
in this deserted place

28:28.640 --> 28:29.840
and waste your time.

28:43.520 --> 28:45.520
It has been a thousand years
since she woke up from her dream.

28:46.160 --> 28:49.800
She has finally let go of someone
she once couldn't forget

28:50.720 --> 28:52.040
or meet.

28:53.280 --> 28:54.760
Do you really believe she has forgotten?

28:56.320 --> 28:59.360
Only she knows if she's forgotten.

29:00.920 --> 29:04.000
As long as she can let go,
it doesn't matter if I believe it or not.

29:07.400 --> 29:09.160
What about you? Have you let go?

29:11.520 --> 29:13.440
What do I need to let go of?

29:14.520 --> 29:17.480
Now that we've got Lotus of Life
and enjoyed the story,

29:18.000 --> 29:19.440
let's go to Snow City.

29:32.680 --> 29:33.640
Qian Guang.

29:34.520 --> 29:35.480
I'm sorry.

29:37.000 --> 29:38.440
I didn't keep my promise.

29:39.680 --> 29:41.400
You and I have equal cultivation,

29:41.920 --> 29:45.520
so if I don't agree,
you can't erase my memory.

29:47.960 --> 29:49.880
It's painful to have memories,

29:50.760 --> 29:52.880
but I still don't want to forget you.

29:55.120 --> 29:58.920
I will try to accomplish what you want.

30:00.720 --> 30:03.840
To see all beings and their lives.

30:05.320 --> 30:09.040
I'll be as free, carefree,
proud, and honest

30:09.640 --> 30:12.360
as you want me to be.

30:27.520 --> 30:29.360
BRIGHT SNOWY PAVILION

30:29.440 --> 30:30.560
Mr. Nan.

30:30.640 --> 30:33.600
Please pass this on to Feng Yao.

30:34.120 --> 30:35.000
I'd like to give her a small gift

30:35.760 --> 30:37.520
to thank her for taking care of me
these past few days.

30:38.120 --> 30:40.840
Have you totally healed?

30:43.800 --> 30:45.560
The demonic energy
in my body was expelled,

30:46.160 --> 30:49.320
but it created an obsession,
so I still have inner demons.

30:50.080 --> 30:52.760
Those who have inner demons
may not be evil,

30:52.840 --> 30:56.000
and those who do not
may not be free of evil thoughts.

30:56.680 --> 31:00.200
Many things change
because of a single thought.

31:01.960 --> 31:03.000
Fate.

31:04.080 --> 31:05.280
Do you also have obsessions?

31:07.480 --> 31:08.840
Do you want to observe my heart?

31:12.040 --> 31:13.520
I am disturbed by inner demons,

31:14.600 --> 31:16.400
so if I could stand on top
of millions of years,

31:17.200 --> 31:18.960
would I be able to comprehend it?

31:21.720 --> 31:23.080
Time is not the key

31:26.000 --> 31:28.760
to whether you can comprehend it or not.

31:29.280 --> 31:30.720
Comprehending it is easy,
but doing it is hard.

31:31.320 --> 31:34.880
If I can remember and forget,

31:36.120 --> 31:37.600
I need not force it.

31:43.880 --> 31:44.800
Farewell.

32:04.760 --> 32:07.160
Are you really going to keep avoiding him?

32:08.920 --> 32:10.480
Xuanxin is a meticulous observer,

32:11.320 --> 32:14.520
so it would be better for both of us
if we didn't see each other anymore.

32:17.480 --> 32:19.320
He may have noticed.

32:30.280 --> 32:32.360
You're surely a family,

32:34.200 --> 32:36.640
so you guys like the same things.

32:39.400 --> 32:40.640
We don't have to reunite.

32:42.400 --> 32:43.760
It'll be fine if he and I

32:45.680 --> 32:46.680
are both fine.

33:02.120 --> 33:03.520
Why are you here so late?

33:04.560 --> 33:05.600
Did you cry?

33:07.360 --> 33:08.200
I didn't.

33:08.280 --> 33:11.520
The evening breeze is a bit cool today,
causing my eyes to be a bit dry.

33:12.920 --> 33:17.320
I noticed something unusual
in the sky tonight.

33:17.400 --> 33:19.240
These two stars are bright and dim

33:19.320 --> 33:20.480
and very unfavorable to me,

33:21.760 --> 33:24.440
so I did a divination

33:25.760 --> 33:27.960
and found out
that I have to give my beloved one

33:28.040 --> 33:30.320
her beloved things to solve it.

33:30.400 --> 33:33.320
The people I love can only protect me
when she's happy.

33:33.400 --> 33:35.040
Whether I want to protect you or not

33:35.120 --> 33:38.760
depends on whether your gift
is to my liking or not.

33:38.840 --> 33:40.040
Of course.

34:07.080 --> 34:08.560
It seems

34:08.639 --> 34:11.239
I have quite the talent
for casting artifacts.

34:11.960 --> 34:16.080
I recast Hossu Sword perfectly
with just a little research.

34:16.159 --> 34:17.199
How's that?

34:20.520 --> 34:23.440
Hossu Sword
is different from ordinary swords.

34:23.520 --> 34:26.560
Its blade is repulsive to all ores,

34:27.080 --> 34:28.400
so there has never
been a way to recast it.

34:29.440 --> 34:31.520
You must have put
a lot of thought into it.

34:33.800 --> 34:34.679
Fu Lansheng.

34:36.120 --> 34:37.159
Thank you.

34:39.000 --> 34:40.639
Why do you need to say thank you to me?

34:41.280 --> 34:44.840
I want to see you and this sword
on top of the Humans.

34:47.040 --> 34:50.360
Those were just arrogant words
in my ignorance.

34:50.440 --> 34:54.600
I've seen my own mediocrity
long after all the events I've endured.

34:55.440 --> 34:58.320
I have nine channels
and have trained for over a decade,

34:58.400 --> 34:59.840
but I am still at the Golden Core stage.

35:00.840 --> 35:03.160
My master has passed
on his life's cultivation to me,

35:03.240 --> 35:05.480
but I have only just
broken through spirit manifestation.

35:06.800 --> 35:07.920
Along the way,

35:08.520 --> 35:10.320
I have wanted to do many things

35:10.920 --> 35:12.920
but have accomplished very few.

35:15.840 --> 35:17.120
The Hossu Sword

35:17.200 --> 35:19.800
is the symbol
of successive Mirage Palace leaders.

35:20.720 --> 35:22.120
But that day in the Dark Abyss,

35:24.200 --> 35:25.800
I couldn't even hold onto it.

35:26.600 --> 35:27.920
The Hossu Sword was broken

35:28.000 --> 35:30.280
because of my incompetence after all.

35:32.560 --> 35:33.560
That is why

35:34.600 --> 35:36.560
you refused your seniors' offer

35:36.640 --> 35:39.000
to succeed you in the Mirage Palace.

35:45.080 --> 35:47.760
Qiumin. You are extraordinary.

35:48.360 --> 35:49.480
You were willing

35:49.560 --> 35:52.600
to lay down your life
to save your seniors who had taunted you,

35:53.400 --> 35:56.120
and you defied He Xianwo,
who was so much more powerful than you.

35:57.000 --> 36:00.440
You've been in danger many times
but stepped forward without hesitation.

36:01.200 --> 36:05.080
Also, you often say things
that I find shocking.

36:06.400 --> 36:09.560
Human nature makes us avoid harm,

36:11.560 --> 36:15.160
but you've always done
what you knew you couldn't do.

36:17.280 --> 36:19.800
Every time I saw that, I wondered

36:20.640 --> 36:22.120
if I should try harder

36:23.600 --> 36:24.880
or be braver.

36:30.360 --> 36:33.840
Today, why do you always say nice things?

36:34.760 --> 36:36.120
Those aren't nice

36:39.560 --> 36:40.640
but true.

36:41.640 --> 36:42.520
Qiumin.

36:43.880 --> 36:45.760
You've illuminated me in many moments

36:47.280 --> 36:48.560
when you weren't aware.

36:48.640 --> 36:51.960
I'm sure you'll illuminate
many more others.

36:54.480 --> 36:56.080
If you don't believe in yourself,

36:57.000 --> 36:58.160
you can believe in me.

37:06.880 --> 37:08.080
Not only me,

37:09.360 --> 37:10.560
but many people believe in you.

37:34.560 --> 37:36.400
Among all my disciples,

37:36.480 --> 37:37.520
you are the only one

37:37.600 --> 37:39.280
who has never
intentionally tried to realize

37:39.360 --> 37:41.760
but has achieved no obsession.

37:42.560 --> 37:44.840
No obsession means no inner demons.

37:44.920 --> 37:45.760
Xuanxin.

37:46.280 --> 37:49.120
Your faith has surpassed mine.

37:54.240 --> 37:55.840
No, Master.

37:56.560 --> 37:59.920
I also have obsessions
as well as inner demons.

38:00.520 --> 38:02.160
Obsessions. Inner demons.

38:02.240 --> 38:05.280
One thought can make
you immortal or demonic.

38:05.880 --> 38:09.440
Is there really no way
to rid the world of inner demons?

38:10.200 --> 38:11.440
I'm sorry.

38:22.720 --> 38:25.000
As Lord of the Immortal Alliance,

38:25.080 --> 38:27.680
am I really incapable
of ridding the world of demons?

38:27.760 --> 38:29.040
Greed, anger, stupidity.

38:29.120 --> 38:30.400
Live with obsessions.

38:30.480 --> 38:32.560
Your faith is unstable.

38:38.000 --> 38:39.840
Forget what you should forget.

38:45.480 --> 38:48.600
What you have not gained
won't make you obsessive.

38:49.440 --> 38:50.360
If you fail to keep something,

38:50.440 --> 38:53.040
how can you not have an obsession?

38:53.120 --> 38:54.520
So what if you have the goods
without the obsession?

38:54.600 --> 38:58.360
So what if you have
or don't have an obsession?

38:59.200 --> 39:00.520
The world is endless.

39:01.160 --> 39:02.440
Life is like the morning dew.

39:03.280 --> 39:06.480
All origins are zero.

39:06.560 --> 39:09.600
All origins are zero.

39:09.680 --> 39:12.240
So what if you have
or don't have an obsession?

39:12.320 --> 39:15.680
Why obsessed with obsession?
The world is endless.

39:15.760 --> 39:17.000
Life is like the morning dew.

39:17.080 --> 39:20.160
All origins are zero.

39:22.320 --> 39:23.200
Xuanxin.

39:23.960 --> 39:25.080
I believe

39:25.840 --> 39:27.240
you'll make it.

39:45.640 --> 39:49.320
Mind's emergence
gave birth to all kinds of obsessions,

39:50.280 --> 39:53.960
and its demise
gave birth to all kinds of demons.

39:55.360 --> 39:57.360
So what if there are obsessions?

39:58.240 --> 40:01.240
I wouldn't have inner demons
even if I had obsessions.

40:22.600 --> 40:24.760
Why did you lay a death trap in Snow City?

40:25.440 --> 40:27.000
Tomorrow, the Demon Lord will come,

40:27.840 --> 40:29.200
so I'm inviting him into this trap.

40:31.560 --> 40:33.400
Don't you believe
Mu Xuanling can fulfill her plan?

40:34.920 --> 40:36.280
I don't believe in anything.

40:41.800 --> 40:42.680
Feng Yao.

40:44.000 --> 40:46.360
Do you know what the world in the painting

40:47.560 --> 40:49.120
and the world out of it are?

40:52.560 --> 40:55.200
The in-painting world is your creation.

40:56.320 --> 40:59.920
The outside world is where we really are.

41:00.520 --> 41:01.800
How do you know

41:02.480 --> 41:06.400
if you're in or out of the painting?

41:11.160 --> 41:14.520
With my heart, I don't have to know.

41:14.600 --> 41:16.560
It's the same wherever I am.

41:19.160 --> 41:20.680
With your heart?

41:33.000 --> 41:35.200
If the heart can solve everything,

41:37.520 --> 41:39.280
everything will be fine.

41:56.280 --> 41:57.640
Why are you in a hurry to get the sword?

41:58.320 --> 42:02.360
Since we're in the old haunt,
why don't we feel it?

42:03.480 --> 42:04.600
What trick are you playing now?

42:05.760 --> 42:07.760
It's just a trap for you.

42:21.960 --> 42:24.200
Once again, you're teaming up

42:24.720 --> 42:26.280
with him to find a way to get at me?

42:26.880 --> 42:27.960
Not exactly.

42:29.000 --> 42:31.280
When I brought you
to Ethereal Jade Island and Snow Cliff,

42:31.360 --> 42:32.800
I lied to you on the way,

42:33.480 --> 42:35.120
but I never meant to hurt you

42:36.200 --> 42:37.480
but to purify you,

42:38.280 --> 42:40.440
-to help you get back on the right path.
-Back on the right path?

42:41.280 --> 42:42.720
Whether I'm good or evil,

42:42.800 --> 42:44.560
I am what I am, so how do you purify me?

42:45.280 --> 42:47.920
You're just like all those stupid beings

42:48.000 --> 42:49.760
who want a righteous light that cares

42:49.840 --> 42:51.520
for the world
and sacrifices itself for others.

42:54.480 --> 42:55.600
You…

43:10.960 --> 43:11.800
This…

43:12.560 --> 43:14.040
This ice is weird…

43:19.320 --> 43:20.440
Exactly.

43:21.360 --> 43:22.560
What is going on here?

43:23.240 --> 43:25.040
The Demon Lord cannot be purified.

43:26.000 --> 43:28.320
The only way to purify him

43:28.400 --> 43:30.280
is to kill him.

43:34.520 --> 43:36.720
But I saw the method of purification
in The Book of Fate.

43:36.800 --> 43:39.040
You never entered the real Book of Fate.

43:39.840 --> 43:42.120
You entered an illusion that I created.

43:42.800 --> 43:46.280
What you saw was what I wanted you to see.

43:46.880 --> 43:49.200
You deliberately used the Purification

43:49.720 --> 43:51.440
of Demon Lord as bait

43:52.240 --> 43:54.360
to lure me into your plan of killing him.

43:55.640 --> 43:56.480
That's right.

43:57.040 --> 43:58.840
I said Waterless Land
would cleanse the demon's body,

44:00.080 --> 44:02.760
but I actually wanted
to crush his soul with spiritual water.

44:02.840 --> 44:04.680
I said Snow Cliff's ice
could lock up the demon's bones,

44:05.840 --> 44:08.240
but I actually wanted
to kill the demon's spirit

44:09.160 --> 44:10.240
with the ice of a thousand years.

44:11.680 --> 44:13.520
Now, all that's left is the final step,

44:13.600 --> 44:15.720
which is to use the Chaos Power

44:16.240 --> 44:18.960
to kill Demon Lord completely.

44:25.600 --> 44:27.640
The Chaos Power was given to you by me,

44:28.160 --> 44:29.880
so, naturally, I can seal it.

44:29.960 --> 44:32.880
Even if you seal the Chaos Power,

44:33.480 --> 44:34.800
so what?

44:36.040 --> 44:38.320
I have already laid a dragnet in the city.

44:38.400 --> 44:41.520
Xuanxin broke through the spiritual form
and upgraded the curse.

44:42.040 --> 44:44.920
He's leading
the Immortal Alliance on the outside.

44:46.680 --> 44:47.880
Demon Lord.

44:49.480 --> 44:51.360
You can't escape Snow City.

44:52.880 --> 44:55.160
Why did you have to kill him?

44:55.240 --> 44:57.640
Because when
Hao Tian comes into the world,

44:58.160 --> 45:00.000
he will destroy it.

45:00.800 --> 45:04.000
And Demon Lord is connected to Hao Tian.

45:05.080 --> 45:08.360
Hao Tian created the world,
so how could he destroy it?

45:08.960 --> 45:11.880
This is not something
that can be explained in a few words.

45:12.880 --> 45:14.240
All you need to remember

45:15.240 --> 45:16.360
is that if you don't kill the Demon Lord,

45:16.440 --> 45:18.200
Hao Tian will surely destroy the world

45:18.720 --> 45:20.560
after he comes.

45:32.440 --> 45:34.640
Do you want to see the world

45:34.720 --> 45:37.480
that Xie Xuechen
has fought so hard to protect

45:38.240 --> 45:40.040
being completely destroyed?

45:43.960 --> 45:46.640
Demon Lord's evil thoughts
were imposed by The Book of Fate,

45:48.560 --> 45:50.960
but even so,
his good thoughts are still intact,

45:51.880 --> 45:53.560
so he shouldn't be killed just like that.

45:56.280 --> 45:57.600
If you miss this opportunity,

45:58.440 --> 46:00.440
you will never be able to kill me again.

46:00.960 --> 46:02.160
Think well.

46:09.680 --> 46:10.800
After all that happened,

46:11.400 --> 46:13.720
I've seen that you're not an evil person.

46:15.280 --> 46:16.840
Even with the coming of Hao Tian,

46:17.440 --> 46:19.400
I believe that man
can triumph over the immortal.

46:20.000 --> 46:22.240
Just like Zhao Ming and Xie Xuechen,

46:22.840 --> 46:24.640
we are all fighting against the immortal.

46:26.600 --> 46:28.240
I am evil by nature,

46:29.720 --> 46:31.360
but you answered quite well.

46:42.120 --> 46:43.360
The time has come.
